# Jake gains life for each landfall trigger; only the second resolution that turn investigates (CR 701.16).
# A Fabled Passage fetches a Forest after entering, so landfall resolves twice; then Arboreal Grazer puts a third land onto
# the battlefield, and that third resolution gains life but does not investigate again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Jake Sisko, War Correspondent
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Fabled Passage
Forest
Arboreal Grazer
Forest x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Jake Sisko, War Correspondent.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Fabled Passage.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Fabled Passage.Activate
Bot1.Search(Forest)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Life = 22
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Arboreal Grazer.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Forest)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

